{"id":"wb-3-239","name":"打虎亭汉墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"打虎亭汉墓","text":"打虎亭汉墓位于中国河南省郑州新密市的牛店镇打虎亭村，分为东西两墓，发现时地表残存两座高十余米大冢，西冢较大，编为一号墓，东冢较小，编为二号墓。两者的墓室都采用砖石混合结构，并用白灰砌缝筑成。墓内有画像石并绘有壁画。其中二号墓的壁画发掘于1960年至1961年。\n该墓是中国现存规模最大的汉代墓地之一，1982年列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E4%BA%AD%E6%B1%89%E5%A2%93","revisionId":94312423,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94312423","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/19d13a441bfc8c593178adb1.jpg","title":"20260221_Dahuting_No._1_Tomb_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260221_Dahuting_No._1_Tomb_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/20260221_Dahuting_No._1_Tomb_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​打虎亭1号汉墓","width":320,"height":213}}